\\begin{aligned}∇\\cdot F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-{e}^{x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y-{e}^{x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡y). \\\\  & =2{e}^{x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point  $(0,\\frac{\\pi }{2}),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(∇\\cdot F)(0,\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =2{e}^{0}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 1\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324875 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324876 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324877 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324878 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324879 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1041 "selection" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1104 #edb/ref 17592186324875 13194139534985 true] [17592186324874 1110 #uuid "c2c84de9-52d4-5047-b3f1-7fbc6f34ac87" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324875 1034 "2" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324875 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534985 true] [17592186324875 1111 #uuid "a044a129-6bc8-5de8-9b52-bd5246e816e1" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324876 1034 "1" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324876 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534985 true] [17592186324876 1111 #uuid "3079ff4e-9506-5355-9ac0-065be3f96d37" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324877 1034 "0" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324877 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534985 true] [17592186324877 1111 #uuid "35efbc4b-eee7-5ee0-b4ee-782c677bec3e" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324878 1034 "-1" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324878 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534985 true] [17592186324878 1111 #uuid "e913c30d-7bd8-5430-8ba6-d7b9d40904c1" 13194139534985 true] [17592186324879 1034 "-2" 13194139534985